! XRT-07 RT02(IOL 17.15・据付・変更しない)。PE= XR01 とループバック間で iBGP。お客さま A の 10.20/16 は BGP だけで広告。
! 社内の標準= LDP の ID は Lo0・IS-IS と同期。RT03 との LDP は MD5(RT03 がパスワード必須)。
mpls label protocol ldp
mpls ldp router-id Loopback0 force
mpls ldp neighbor 10.255.0.13 password CoreLdp-2026
!
interface Loopback0
 ip address 10.255.0.12 255.255.255.255
 ip router isis CORE
!
interface Loopback100
 description CUSTOMER-A (advertised in BGP only)
 ip address 10.20.0.1 255.255.0.0
!
interface {{ links[0] }}
 description CORE-A to RT01
 ip address 10.0.12.12 255.255.255.0
 ip router isis CORE
 isis network point-to-point
 isis metric 10
 mpls ip
 no shutdown
!
interface {{ links[1] }}
 description CORE-B to RT03
 ip address 10.0.23.12 255.255.255.0
 ip router isis CORE
 isis network point-to-point
 isis metric 100
 mpls ip
 no shutdown
!
router isis CORE
 net 49.0001.0100.0000.0012.00
 is-type level-2-only
 metric-style wide
 log-adjacency-changes
 mpls ldp sync
!
router bgp 65000
 bgp router-id 10.255.0.12
 bgp log-neighbor-changes
 neighbor 10.255.0.1 remote-as 65000
 neighbor 10.255.0.1 update-source Loopback0
 address-family ipv4
  network 10.20.0.0 mask 255.255.0.0
  neighbor 10.255.0.1 activate
 exit-address-family
!
